			"notes": "v2.2.0 \"Prelude\" update:\n\n* Dimensional Rift is now MUCH more optimized (no longer will I get 15 frames without optimization mods :D)\n\n* Soulfood has been massively changed:\n~ No longer prevents experience gain, but instead it reduces it by 75%\n~ Experience orbs can only give experience when at full hunger\n~ Experience gained from Bottle' O Enchanting is now completely reliable\n~ Planeswalkers cannot use enchanting tables or access the enchanting screen\n\n\n* Descriptions had various tweaking\n\n* Version is updated"
		},
